{"book":"zhongyong","id":"sishu.zhongyong.10","index":10,"passages":[{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.10.01","number":1,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"lù","traditional":"路","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"问","pinyin":"wèn","traditional":"問","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"强","pinyin":"qiáng","traditional":"強","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Zilu (Zi Lu - Cu Lo) bertanya hal keperwiraan."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.10.02","number":2,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yuē","traditional":"曰","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"：“"},{"pinyin":"nán","traditional":"南","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"fāng","traditional":"方","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"强","pinyin":"qiáng","traditional":"強","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"与","pinyin":"yú","traditional":"與","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"？"},{"pinyin":"běi","traditional":"北","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"fāng","traditional":"方","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"强","pinyin":"qiáng","traditional":"強","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"与","pinyin":"yú","traditional":"與","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"？"},{"pinyin":"yì","traditional":"抑","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"强","pinyin":"qiáng","traditional":"強","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"与","pinyin":"yú","traditional":"與","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"？"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Nabi bersabda, \"Keperwiraan dari daerah Selatankah, keperwiraan dari daerah Utarakah, atau keperwiraan sejati?","editorial_annotations":[{"id":"sishu.zhongyong.10.02.note.yu-pronunciation","kind":"interpretive_comparison","after_paragraph_index":0,"anchor_hanzi":"南方之強與？北方之強與？抑而強與","title_indonesian":"Catatan bacaan 與 — kontekstual yú, cetakan MATAKIN yǔ","attribution":"Kamus Kementerian Pendidikan Taiwan; Zhu Xi《四書章句集註》","hanzi":"子曰：「南方之強與，北方之強與，抑而強與？」（與平聲）","description_indonesian":"Dalam kalimat tanya Zhong Yong Bab IX:2, tiga 與 merupakan partikel tanya yang setara dengan 歟, bukan kata penghubung, sehingga bacaan yang didukung kamus Kementerian Pendidikan Taiwan adalah yú. Zhu Xi mencatat 與平聲. Foto langsung Si Shu MATAKIN 2012 halaman cetak 42 menunjukkan pinyin yǔ untuk ketiganya. Ru Classics menampilkan bacaan kontekstual yú dan secara terbuka mencatat yǔ sebagai bacaan cetakan MATAKIN, bukan mengganti atau menghapus bukti primer. Hanzi, tanda baca, terjemahan Indonesia, dan status editorial tidak diubah oleh keputusan pinyin ini.","source_basis":{"main_edition":"Si Shu MATAKIN 2012, foto langsung Zhong Yong Bab IX:2","witness_file":"KR1h0015_016.txt","witness_page":"KR1h0015_WYG_016-42a","source_commit":"84c6b2c5093c57ae5d41c60a73c02323d2420ef0","witness_url":"https://github.com/kanripo/KR1h0015/blob/84c6b2c5093c57ae5d41c60a73c02323d2420ef0/KR1h0015_016.txt","lexicon":"Kementerian Pendidikan Taiwan — 與, yú sebagai partikel tanya","lexicon_url":"https://dict.revised.moe.edu.tw/dictView.jsp?ID=11608&la=0&powerMode=0","printed_page":42,"printed_pinyin":"yǔ","contextual_pinyin":"yú"},"review_status":"contextual-pinyin-verified-printed-variant-recorded","editorial_policy":"Hanzi dan terjemahan Indonesia mengikuti MATAKIN. Pinyin dinilai menurut fungsi kata dalam konteks dan leksikon; jika cetakan berbeda, tampilkan pinyin kontekstual dan dokumentasikan bacaan cetak secara eksplisit; jangan tandai Final otomatis."}]},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.10.03","number":3,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"modern":"宽","pinyin":"kuān","traditional":"寬","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"róu","traditional":"柔","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"以","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jiào","traditional":"教","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"报","pinyin":"bào","traditional":"報","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"无","pinyin":"wú","traditional":"無","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dào","traditional":"道","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"nán","traditional":"南","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"fāng","traditional":"方","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"强","pinyin":"qiáng","traditional":"強","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"jūn","traditional":"君","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jū","traditional":"居","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"\"Dengan lemah lembut mendidik sesama, tidak membalas perbuatan yang ingkar dari Jalan Suci; itulah keperwiraan dari Selatan yang juga dipegang teguh oleh seorang Junzi - Kuncu. (S.S. XII:16)."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.10.04","number":4,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"rèn","traditional":"衽","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jīn","traditional":"金","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"gé","traditional":"革","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"sǐ","traditional":"死","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"厌","pinyin":"yàn","traditional":"厭","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"běi","traditional":"北","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"fāng","traditional":"方","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"强","pinyin":"qiáng","traditional":"強","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"强","pinyin":"qiáng","traditional":"強","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhě","traditional":"者","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jū","traditional":"居","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"\"Rebah dengan tetap mengenakan pakaian perang dan senjata, mati dengan tidak menaruh sesal; itulah keperwiraan dari Utara yang juga dipegang teguh oleh seorang yang gagah berani."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.zhongyong.10.05","number":5,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"gù","traditional":"故","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jūn","traditional":"君","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"hé","traditional":"和","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"liú","traditional":"流","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"；"},{"modern":"强","pinyin":"qiáng","traditional":"強","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zāi","traditional":"哉","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"矫","pinyin":"jiǎo","traditional":"矯","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"zhōng","traditional":"中","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"lì","traditional":"立","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ér","traditional":"而","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"倚","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"；"},{"modern":"强","pinyin":"qiáng","traditional":"強","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zāi","traditional":"哉","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"矫","pinyin":"jiǎo","traditional":"矯","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"modern":"国","pinyin":"guó","traditional":"國","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǒu","traditional":"有","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dào","traditional":"道","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"变","pinyin":"biàn","traditional":"變","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"sāi","traditional":"塞","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yān","traditional":"焉","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"；"},{"modern":"强","pinyin":"qiáng","traditional":"強","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zāi","traditional":"哉","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"矫","pinyin":"jiǎo","traditional":"矯","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"modern":"国","pinyin":"guó","traditional":"國","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"无","pinyin":"wú","traditional":"無","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dào","traditional":"道","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"zhì","traditional":"至","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"sǐ","traditional":"死","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"变","pinyin":"biàn","traditional":"變","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"；"},{"modern":"强","pinyin":"qiáng","traditional":"強","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zāi","traditional":"哉","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"矫","pinyin":"jiǎo","traditional":"矯","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。”"}]],"translation_indonesian":"\"Maka seorang Junzi - Kuncu bersikap harmonis, tidak melanda; betapa perwira ia! Bersikap Tengah dalam pendirian dan tidak goyah, betapa perwira ia! Negara di dalam Jalan Suci ia tidak mengubah cita-cita, betapa perwira ia! Negara ingkar dari Jalan Suci, sekalipun binasa ia tidak berubah sikap, betapa perwira ia!\" TENGAH SEMPURNA BAB X (Yang Wajar Dan Tekun)"}],"source_file":"02 - Zhong Yong 中庸/10 - Bab IX - Keperwiraan.md","title":"Bab IX — Keperwiraan"}